<title>USA: Isolyser says court dismisses lawsuit.</title>
<headline>Isolyser says court dismisses lawsuit.</headline>
<dateline>NORCROSS, Ga. 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Isolyser Co Inc said Monday that the United States District Court for the Northern District of Georgia dismissed a lawsuit filed against the company in December 1995.</p>
<p>The company said the plaintiff sought class action certification and damages in connection with alleged wrongful disclosures in various company's filings with the Securities and Exchange Commission.</p>
<p>The company said the plaintiff has 30 days to appeal.</p>
</text>
